

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:8
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_9f80cd8f:

    # "As I pushed open the door, I was instantly greeted by the wide-eyed, shocked look of Regina who rushed towards me, pulling me into an embrace so tight I struggled to breathe."
    "Cuando abrí la puerta, me encontré con la mirada atónita de Regina, que se abalanzó sobre mí y me abrazó tan fuerte que me costaba respirar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:10
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_2d845ee8:

    # REGINA @ shock "{i}*Gasp!*{/i}"
    REGINA @ shock "{i}*¡Jadear!*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:11
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_924e671b:

    # REGINA @ shock_talk "You’re home!"
    REGINA @ shock_talk "¡Estás en casa!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:12
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_e3fcdbfa:

    # MC @ talk "Yes, everything is gonna be alright now."
    MC @ talk "Sí, ahora todo va a ir bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:13
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_f539344e:

    # MC @ talk "Both me and Markus are safe."
    MC @ talk "Markus y yo estamos a salvo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:14
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_45c85e46:

    # REGINA @ shock_talk "When they said you and Markus were the only survivors, I couldn’t believe it!"
    REGINA @ shock_talk "Cuando dijeron que Markus y tú erais los únicos supervivientes, ¡no me lo podía creer!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:15
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_0fd458a8:

    # MC @ talk "Who told you?"
    MC @ talk "¿Quién te lo dijo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:16
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_82b06c87:

    # REGINA @ shock_talk "Haven’t you heard the criers in the streets?"
    REGINA @ shock_talk "¿No has oído a los pregoneros en las calles?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:17
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_3fde6b24:

    # REGINA @ shock_talk "Your posters have been put up everywhere!"
    REGINA @ shock_talk "¡Vuestros carteles están colgados en todas partes!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:18
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_d1e8628e:

    # REGINA @ shock_talk "You’re basically famous!"
    REGINA @ shock_talk "¡Vosotros sois básicamente famosos!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:19
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_fea71089:

    # REGINA @ talk "When I told them I thought it was you, they brought me in to identify you both."
    REGINA @ talk "Cuando les dije que creía que erais vosotros, me trajeron para identificaros a los dos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:20
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_a99eb354:

    # MC @ talk "I’m sorry you had to see me like that."
    MC @ talk "Siento que hayas tenido que verme así."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:21
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_7e7939d7:

    # REGINA @ sad_talk "It was better than not seeing you at all."
    REGINA @ sad_talk "Era mejor que no verte en absoluto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:22
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_d9589509:

    # "Tears began to well in her eyes and she cupped my face with her warm hands before wrapping her arms around me for a second time, clinging to me for as long as I let her."
    "Se le llenaron los ojos de lágrimas y me acarició la cara con sus cálidas manos antes de rodearme con los brazos por segunda vez, aferrándose a mí todo el tiempo que se lo permití."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:23
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_9fa7811a:

