    # REGINA @ talk "Been worried sick about the pair of you ever since you left but other than that I’m okay."
    REGINA @ talk "He estado muy preocupada por vosotros dos desde que os fuisteis, pero aparte de eso estoy bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:41
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_5d14884b:

    # MC @ talk "We made it back, that’s what matters."
    MC @ talk "Hemos vuelto, eso es lo que importa."

