translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_7ae97ce6:

    # "Regina’s expression was unusually neutral as I told her what little I could remember."
    "La expresión de Regina era inusualmente neutra cuando le conté lo poco que recordaba."

