    # REGINA @ talk "Then be thankful that the spirit saved your life and keep your mouth shut."
    REGINA @ talk "Entonces agradece que el espíritu te haya salvado la vida y mantén la boca cerrada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:89
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_ReturnHome_ReginaTalk_81d493e8:

    # REGINA @ talk "If it turns out that {i}was{/i} a spirit that’s attached itself to you and it’s dangerous, then I will deal with it."
    REGINA @ talk "Si resulta que {i}era{/i} un espíritu que se te ha pegado y es peligroso, entonces me ocuparé de él."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr02.rpy:90
